, Twitch game streaming, podcasting, Zoom meetings, music recording and more", "Blue VO!CE software: Elevate your streamings and recordings with clear broadcast vocal sound and entertain your audience with enhanced effects, advanced modulation and HD audio samples", "Four pickup patterns: Flexible cardioid, omni, bidirectional, and stereo pickup patterns allow you to record in ways that would normally require multiple mics, for vocals, instruments and podcasts", "Onboard audio controls: Headphone volume, pattern selection, instant mute, and mic gain put you in charge of every level of the audio recording and streaming process", "Positionable design: Pivot the mic in relation to the sound source to optimize your sound quality thanks to the adjustable desktop stand and track your voice in real time with no-latency monitoring"]}, "B0GFSBQVRG": {"rating": 4.6, "reviews": 107, "bullets": ["Timeless Vintage Display Design: Inspired by classic hand crank sewing machines, this beautifully crafted model brings warmth, nostalgia, and refined character to your desk, shelf, or office. The eleg", "Smooth Moving Gear Experience: Simply turn the hand crank and watch the needle move up and down while the internal gears rotate smoothly in sync. This interactive motion delivers a calming, hands-on e", "Hidden Mini Tailor Shop Scene: Open the base to reveal a miniature tailor shop featuring fabric racks, dress form, ironing board, sewing tools, and more. This hidden scene adds depth, surprise, and st", "Exclusive Tailor Grandma Minifigure: Includes a unique tailor grandma minifigure exclusive to PANTASY, bringing warmth and life to the model. Perfect for display, photography, or storytelling, it crea", "Premium Craftsmanship for Adults: Features gold spray coated elements, precision pad printed details, and a quick release base for easy viewing of the internal structure. Designed for adult collectors"]}}, "clips": {"B0BCXF3T1W": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcodin